# Velora Project Rules

## Architecture
- Monorepo using pnpm workspaces.
- `packages/css`: Core CSS system with tokens, layout, and components (Cascade Layers).
- `apps/playground`: Development and testing environment.

## CSS Best Practices
- Use CSS Variables (Tokens) defined in `01-tokens.css`.
- Follow cascade layer order: reset → tokens → layout → motion → components → transitions → utilities → overrides (see `velora.css`).
- Prioritize CSS custom properties over hardcoded values; colors use `oklch()`.
- Design for both dark and light modes.
- Use smooth transitions and modern easing functions.

## Naming Conventions
- CSS Variables prefixed with `--vl-`.
- Component and layout classes prefixed with `.vl-`.
- Components should be encapsulated within `@layer`.
